{"id":"n85627-10-8","stage":0,"title":"바람 · 风","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85627-10-8-1","ko":"지수가 달리기를 참 잘하더라.","zh":"智秀跑得真快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"달리기를","meaning":"跑步","explanation":"달리기：跑步；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"달리기","audio":"/audio/4c47747ba8ec10732144.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28388","senseId":"1","lemma":"달리기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하더라.","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4c47747ba8ec1073","term":"달리기","zh":"跑步","audio":"/audio/4c47747ba8ec10732144.mp3","entryId":"28388","definition":"两脚交互向前迅速跃进。","pronunciation":["달리기"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6bb006cdccb4bf2d68f9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85627-10-8-2","ko":"아주 바람같이 달리던데?","zh":"简直跑得像风一样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람같이","meaning":"风","explanation":"바람：风；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"10","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달리던데?","meaning":"跑，奔跑，快跑","explanation":"달리다：跑，奔跑，快跑；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"달리다","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66321","senseId":"1","lemma":"달리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"非常快。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"605b9178b6748898","term":"달리다","zh":"跑，奔跑，快跑","audio":"/audio/605b9178b6748898219d.mp3","entryId":"66321","definition":"快速跑着过去或过来。","pronunciation":["달리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9708ddf7b22d935a3deb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":0.98,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85627","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"10","sourceLevel":"초급","day":9,"sequenceScore":0.0984,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["简直跑得像风一样呢。","智秀跑得真快啊。","现在几点了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀跑得真快啊。","现在几点了？","简直跑得像风一样呢。"],"answer":2}]}
